       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِنِّى أَرَى الشَّرَّ نَبَّبَ</span> (assumed tropical:)  [<i>Verily
